OL,3,GNEWSAReform's third council leader in a
OL,4,Ayear steps down
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Reform UK leader of Staffordshire
OL,7,FCounty Council has announced his
OL,8,Fdecision to step down after seven
OL,9,Fmonths in the role.
OL,11,FMartin Murray, who was formally elected
OL,12,Fin March, confirmed he had resigned as
OL,13,Fboth the authority's leader and as
OL,14,Fleader of its Reform group on Tuesday,
OL,15,Fadding it was in the "best interests"
OL,16,Fof Staffordshire and its residents.
OL,18,FMurray's departure is the latest in a
OL,19,Fseries of leadership changes in
OL,20,FStaffordshire since December 2025,
OL,21,Ffollowing the exits of Ian Cooper and
OL,22,FChris Large.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
