OL,3,GNEWSAReform's third council leader in a
OL,4,Ayear steps down
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy leader Hayley Coles had been
OL,7,Fselected as the party's fourth group
OL,8,Fleader and would serve as acting leader
OL,9,Fof the county council, a Reform
OL,10,Fspokesperson confirmed.
